     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I have a data frame with a few columns and I would like to separate each column into 3 separate columns.</div><div><br></div><div>library(tidyr)</div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\">x &lt;- data.frame(x1=c(&#39;1:2:3&#39;,&#39;2:3:4&#39;),x2=c(&#39;5:6:7&#39;,&#39;7:8:9&#39;))</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><br></span></pre></div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\">tidyr::separate(data=x,col=&#39;x1&#39;,into=c(&#39;a&#39;,&#39;b&#39;,&#39;c&#39;),sep=&#39;:&#39;)\r\n</span>  a b c    x2\r\n1 1 2 3 5:6:7\r\n2 2 3 4 7:8:9</pre></div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\">tidyr::separate(data=x[&#39;x1&#39;],col=&#39;x1&#39;,into=c(&#39;a&#39;,&#39;b&#39;,&#39;c&#39;),sep=&#39;:&#39;)</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\"><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\">  a b c\r\n1 1 2 3\r\n2 2 3 4</pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre></span></pre></div><div>I would like to apply it to all columns, the following did not work</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.8667px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.2533px;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue\">lapply(names(x),function(i) {tidyr::separate(data=x[i],col=i,into=c(&#39;a&#39;,&#39;b&#39;,&#39;c&#39;),sep=&#39;:&#39;)})\r\n</span><div style=\"overflow:hidden;margin-top:5px;margin-right:5px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-top:5px;padding-bottom:5px;padding-left:5px;background-color:rgb(229,229,229)\"><div style=\"float:right;margin-right:10px;margin-left:5px;margin-bottom:15px;line-height:11.0933px\"><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/attach/4c102670cdb5f/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%201?part=0.1\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\"> <a style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Sans&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans&quot;,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Verdana,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11.0933px;opacity:0.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Show Traceback</a></div> <div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/attach/4c102670cdb5f/Auto%20Generated%20Inline%20Image%202?p